Comment: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}Mamoru Kodai
Comment: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1045.5,666)\fs48}{frx10\fry8\frz29.67\fax0.05}{\bord0\c&H604C4C&\2c&H806E6B&}{\blur1.05}Mamoru\NKodai
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:46.44,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the medical team. Yamato, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.45,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Due to emergency circumstances, I'm transmitting unencrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.96,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hit to starboard! Damage minimal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:12.26,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Fighters are to launch and engage the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:13.91,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, fighters are to launch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Teron ship made a hyperspace jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And they destroyed the resupply base? Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Commander Goer... It's clear they broke the light-speed barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a commander in charge of a galactic theater,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,can report such nonsense to imperial command?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shultz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall only be able to report to our lord after you've provided a proper report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm asking, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I'll speak to command about promoting all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from second-class Gamilans to first-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it? I want a proper report, Shultz!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't understand anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the Zupist footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the issue. What could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What could even make something like this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The flight plan the UN's Yamato Plan HQ made does not allow for any lost time at Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, any decision about carrying out Operation M-2 has been left to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We should disable the Pluto base, if only to prevent any troubles with it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe this to be our fastest course out of the solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... Following that course, we'll pass Pluto without mounting any attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.\NHowever, our flight plan has no leeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Report from the main bridge. We've picked up a distress call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,UN Cosmo Force Standard Code. Very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the ship's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't tell. It's coming from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the vicinity of the south pole of Enceladus, one of Saturn's moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Saturn, huh? The opposite direction from Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And from the course you plotted, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:04:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming we go to Enceladus, how many days are lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is my opinion, as the Tactical Officer:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't lose time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Kodai?\NA sailor can't abandon another sailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're unsure there even are survivors, we shouldn't squander valuable time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not what you just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, our priority...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...is to reach Iscandar. Not to destroy the Pluto base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the chance of survivors is minuscule, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine room, status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad... Part of the condenser is on the verge of melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We closed the safety valve, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the emergency breaker apparently didn't activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do nothing, it could paralyze the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will repairs take?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't an easy question. To repair it, we'd need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosmonite 90?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare material required to repair the condenser.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hirata, do we have any on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not nearly enough for the repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There! I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enceladus has an abandoned\Ncosmonite mine. We can resupply there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Change course. Head for Enceladus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However, recovering the cosmonite is our priority. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Teron ship has changed course?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our recon ships show them heading toward the sixth planet, Zedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jarletora, wasn't a recon landing ship stationed near Zedan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Use that. Take prisoners if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The OMCS is amazing. It can make as much of this food as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does it use for raw material?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask hard questions, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's all you want, Sanada?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Consuming unnecessary calories is foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Sanada, what does the OMCS use to make the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,May I sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not against the rescue operation itself. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost your brother on Pluto.\NI understand your desire to redress that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm the same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was a sailor. And he always used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Daisuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailors like your dad never abandon their comrades, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a sailor... A true sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be like him. That's why I became a sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're such good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Both were promoted because those who would have had their jobs got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a friendship between men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just self-absorbed. You shouldn't try to emulate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After inspection, team 5 is to gather in the briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,After inspection, team 5 is to gather in the briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will discuss our maintenance and operation plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Inertial control isn't on in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much stuff in here...\NWe're better off without gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Permission was granted for the extra ammunition you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the accounting going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'm enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a messed-up golf ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On that frozen surface, we've seen geysers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,caused by the tidal pull from Saturn and other planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Landing on Enceladus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Approach angle is fine. Forward at minimum speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Red 15, descent angle 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower bow, and prepare for docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada, you're in charge of the mining site.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Analyzer and a medical team to the distress signal's source.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See if there is anyone you can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, you are to escort Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you are to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a treasure trove...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Boatswain, complete the work as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess Kodai's off to escort the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In training school, I was his instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He never did know how to deal with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll be all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Two girls and a robot alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't need to do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am quite capable. You may leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the escort to you.\NBut on the ground, you obey my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One "right"  is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't those two kind of suspicious together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I detect no suspicious activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a bore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But this distress signal... Who could have sent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I ask a strange question?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you related to any aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, never mind. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now approaching signal source.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely an Earth ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With that conning tower, it's probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,An Isokaze-class assault destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The same type as the Yukikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's frozen over, so I can't read the ship's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori! Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can enter over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only system still working. It's transmitting the distress call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look around a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll find the ship's log.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gamilans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They got the seagull!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You request help from the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm locked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Open, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use...\NAnalyzer, weren't you going to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We are currently under Gamilas attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We require immediate assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We are currently under attack by an enemy armored units.{Pluralization issue, figure out and fix}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you copy, medical team?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine is off line, so both main and secondary guns are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw! Withdraw immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have nearly the forces to attack the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're useful, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've stopped attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, the Yamato is also under fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still recovering the dig team!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to launch from here, we'll need to gain altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on...\NThen what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"It"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they issue launch orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't one of the pilots?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You there! State your name and rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but go assist the medical team!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the medical team. Yamato, please respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical team, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The first aid box!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Gammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This was my brother's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This was my brother's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my brother's Yukikaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yukikaze
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove your helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez... I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the tactical officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.16,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai is giving his report.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Origin of distress call was the destroyer Yukikaze, of the UN Cosmo Force First Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There were no survivors on board...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No survivors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:22:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want the Earth to end up like the Yukikaze, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The planet with the king of the dead's name stands before the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.09,0:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless the planet is overcome, humanity has no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, battle stations! Our target is Pluto!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the Yamato break through the trap that lies in wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest battle of the solar system begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Trap on All Sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.43,0:24:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 362 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:23:00.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The unknown calls to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:12.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Does your courage burn to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We rush on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}For everyone to survive together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}For happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:27.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Though there is pain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}We will not be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Those who know the beautiful Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:45.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Restore its wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bring it back, bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:52.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The road to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Determined to reach our destination
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.03,0:22:29.61,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2000)}{\pos(1411,840)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.03,0:22:29.61,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2000)}{\pos(1049,1073)}Gravestone on a Frozen Field
