Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:38.03,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,500)}{\pos(960,885)}Gamilas Pluto Forward Base
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:08.17,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Target approaching orbit of the eighth satellite.>
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:10.54,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Command priority: capture of crew.>
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:13.67,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Weapons use permitted, as necessary.>
