Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:21.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:28.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:36.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:42.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:47.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.66,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:59.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:24.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
