Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:29.57,TS Default,,100,100,0,,{\an8\c&H7A8A86&\blur5\shad0}{\fade(0,1500)}Here lie the twenty-four brave souls who crewed the Yukikaze.\NMay they rest in peace.
